<title>MALAYSIA: Petronas Gas year net up 13.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Petronas Gas year net up 13.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 833.53   vs	 731.77</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 46.3    vs	  43.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,264.98   vs     1,215.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   860.54   vs	 748.45</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)     15.0    vs	  15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Petronas Gas Bhd. It is a unit of Malaysia's national oil company Petroliam Nasional (Petronas).</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
